'''Lollycat''' (ネコぺろきゃん Neko Perokyan) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Lollycat
|image = E 133.png
|first appearance = [[No Frills Evolution (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Awakened Carnival III (Deadly)]]
|money drop = 1,666¢ - 6,580¢
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with great health, range and attack speed, but lacks in speed and attack power. It'd be really easy if there weren't many strong and annoying peons in every stages that it appears in. Be careful, as there will be multiple of them in the the stage it debuts in.

==Strategy==
This enemy is one of the easiest awakened enemies if not supported by other units. Almost any decent ranged attacker will be able to strike it from a distance. By using just [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] plus [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]/[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] with any other support cats is practically a guaranteed win.

